Subject: William Tugman State Park, Campground Greeting Host, April 5 - 30

Tugman State Park is seeking a Campground Greeting Host to start as early a=
s Saturday, April 5.

Location: William Tugman State Park, South Coast, Lakeside (just north of C=
oos Bay/North Bend)
Time Commitment: 4 hours per day, 5 days per week, 30 total hours per week
Work Schedule: 2PM - 8PM, Friday - Tuesday, Wednesdays and Thursdays off
Campsite:

  *   site A44, a 40' site with water, sewer, & 50 amp electric service.
Amenities: Laundry on site. Cell service (except Verizon). No wifi. 5 minut=
es from grocery store.
Duties: Greet campers and answer questions, communicate issues with staff, =
sell firewood using a vending machine (no cash handling).
See this link for a full position description.<https://stateparks.oregon.go=
v/index.cfm?do=3Dget-involved.volunteer-opening&oppId=3D26873>
Interested and Available? Please contact Park Ranger Franki Allegra
franki.allegra@oprd.oregon.gov<mailto:franki.allegra@oprd.oregon.gov>
541-999-6691


