<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></b></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Location:</b>&nbsp;William Tugman State Park, Sou=
th Coast,&nbsp;Lakeside (just north of Coos Bay/North Bend)<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Time Commitment</b>: 4 hours per day, 5 days per =
week, 30 total hours per week<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Work Schedule:</b> 2PM &#8211; 8PM, Friday &#8211=
; Tuesday, Wednesdays and Thursdays off<o:p></o:p></p>
