217; site with water, sewer, &amp; 50 amp electric service.<o:p></o:p></li>=
</ul>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Amenities</b>: Laundry on site. Cell service (<b>=
except </b>
Verizon). No wifi. 5 minutes from grocery store.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Duties:</b> Greet campers and answer questions, c=
ommunicate issues with staff, sell firewood using a vending machine (no cas=
h handling).<o:p></o:p></p>
